SUMMARY:Virtual REGISTER: What is Successful Aging and How to Achieve it (
 Toronto)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: After you RSVP\, you will also nee
 d to Register to receive the link to this University of Toronto (UofT) Tal
 k under the Signing Up section.**\n\nOn **Wednesday\, May 20th\,** **join 
 a special discussion on What Is Successful Aging\, and How Do We Achieve I
 t** with **Dr. Esme Fuller‑Thomson** and **Dr. Mabel Ho** as they share 
 what Canadians say about aging well and what research tells us. Using nati
 onal data\, they highlight everyday habits and lifestyle choices that can 
 help people age well across Canada.\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\
 n* Simply RSVP Yes\n* **[Register](https://alumni.utoronto.ca/events/what-
 successful-aging-and-how-do-we-achieve-it)** for the talk. UofT will send 
 a confirmation email\, and then email the link to the talk closer to the e
 vent\n* **Start time: 6pm when you will click on link provided by UofT**\n
 * Length: 1 hour\n* RSVPs close 1 day prior to start time\, hoping spots a
 re still available\n*\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
