SUMMARY:The Great Gatsby Musical - $49/$69 + Pre-dinner (Dundas Stn.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: New offer $49/69 until May 19 @ 11
 :59pm.**\n\n**April Fools Sale Buy 1 get the 2nd for $1 expired Apr 6th at
  11:59pm EST.**\n\nOn **Saturday August 15th\, join us for the Broadway Ex
 travaganza and Tony Award®-winning** **The Great Gatsby: A New Musical** 
 that explodes with life and energy” (Entertainment Weekly). Based on the
  classic American novel by F. Scott Fitzgerald\, the Tony Award®-winning 
 new musical is an unforgettable journey of love\, wealth and tragedy that 
 brings the Roaring Twenties to life on stage. My seat is Orchestra N25. **
 Purchase The Great Gatsby: A New Musical on Saturday August 15th at 7:30pm
 .**\n\n**COST**\nRegular Cost: $59/ 79/ 109/ 129/ 159/ 199 + service fees\
 n\n**Discounted Cost: $49/69 applies to all price levels (except the lowes
 t and highest ones**) + service fees. This represents up to $90 off. The l
 ink is embedded in the code. If you can't see it\, use MAYGATSBY\n\nMeetup
  Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**Ticket Policy**: All sales are final\, no refunds 
 or exchanges.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes confirming if you will joi
 n for dinner prior. Note: everyone goes on the waitlist until they post th
 eir seat number**\n* **[Purchase](https://tickets.mirvish.com/gatsby/23779
 ?promoApplied=true)** **your own ticket and select the March 6th date**\, 
 post your seat number and I will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be 
 sent the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and wh
 en.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior and the Waitlist will be removed at that t
 ime. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\
 n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for Dinner: at 5:45pm (location TBC closer t
 o the event date)**\n\n**Meet me for the Show at: 7:15pm inside the CAA Ed
  Mirvish Theatre at 244 Victoria St. (not the Yonge St. entrance)**\, on t
 he ground floor **to the right side after scanning your tickets.**\n\n**St
 art: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: 2 hours 35 mins (incl. intermission)\n\nAfter: me
 et at the same spot to chat about the show\n\nEnjoy and please post your c
 omments in the Event after.
